    "description": {
      "value": "This rune utilizes magical principles used in an immovable rod (Core Rulebook 574).\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYour armor anchors you in place, even defying gravity, rendering you immobilized until you Dismiss the Activation. While you're immobilized in this way, you can be moved only if a creature succeeds at a DC 40 Athletics check to Force Open your armor. You can also be moved if 8,000 pounds of pressure are placed upon you, though this is likely fatal."
